OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 7 FEB
OL,4,G1500FGilles Peterson
OL,5,     GGilles has musician and vocalist
OL,6,     GMomoko Gill in session at BBC
OL,7,     GMaida Vale Studios. Plus, he
OL,8,     Gchats with New York-based DJ and
OL,9,     Gproducer Ge-Ology.
OL,10,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,11,     FShow
OL,12,     GThis week's Trunk of Funk comes
OL,13,     Gfrom Angels of Libra, delivering
OL,14,     Ga 30-minute mix steeped in deep
OL,15,     Gsoul, spiritual jazz and warm,
OL,16,     Gcosmic grooves.
OL,17,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,18,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,19,     Gcross time, space and genre.
OL,20,     GExpect key cuts by the likes of J
OL,21,     GDilla, Pampidoo, Lauryn Hill, The
OL,22,     GAggrovators and Earl Zinger.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
